            <ArticleTitle>Vulvar dysesthesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>51-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic vulvar pain is a significant and misunderstood factor in women's health. Recent new definitions of chronic vulvar dysesthesia have helped to clarify the issue, however the etiology and effective treatment options remain elusive. A systematic approach to the diagnosis and treatment of vulvar dysesthesia is necessary for this difficult and challenging condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
